<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <meta name="description" content="Download Cinnabar for your platform.">
  <title>Cinnabar</title>
  <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="@@FAVICON@@">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/site.css">
  <style>
    main { width: min(100%, 640px); margin: auto; text-align: center; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; }
    .edition { margin: 0; color: var(--muted); font: 400 .875rem/1.6 system-ui, sans-serif; }
    .logo-motion { width: min(100%, 580px); margin-bottom: 8px; }
    .description { margin: 0 0 8px; color: var(--text); font: 400 1.25rem/1.7 system-ui, sans-serif; }
    .actions { display: flex; justify-content: center; align-items: center; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 16px; max-width: 100%; margin-top: 32px; }
    .online-count { min-height: 1.6em; margin: 4px 0 16px; color: var(--sage); text-align: left; font: 400 .8125rem/1.6 system-ui, sans-serif; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
    .online-count:empty { visibility: hidden; }
    .online-count::before { content: ''; display: inline-block; width: 7px; height: 7px; margin-right: 9px; background: #95c783; vertical-align: .1em; }
    .player-history { --chart-height: 148px; width: 100%; margin: 0 0 24px; padding: 24px 0 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); text-align: left; }
    .chart-header { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 8px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
    .chart-header h2 { margin: 0; color: #e1e8de; font: 600 1rem/1.5 system-ui, sans-serif; }
    .chart-ranges { display: flex; gap: 4px; }
    .chart-ranges button { min-width: 44px; min-height: 44px; padding: 4px 8px; border: 1px solid transparent; background: transparent; box-shadow: none; text-shadow: none; color: var(--muted); font: 500 .75rem/1.5 ui-monospace, monospace; }
    .chart-ranges button[aria-pressed="true"] { border-color: #63725c; background: var(--raised); color: #fff; }
    .chart-ranges button:active { transform: none; box-shadow: none; }
    .chart-ranges button:focus-visible { outline-offset: 2px; }
    .chart-summary { min-height: 1.5em; margin: 8px 0 0; color: var(--sage); font-size: .75rem; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
    .chart-body { position: relative; min-height: var(--chart-height); display: grid; align-items: center; }
    #history-plot { display: block; width: 100%; height: var(--chart-height); margin: 8px 0; overflow: visible; touch-action: pan-y; }
    #history-plot[hidden] { display: none; }
    #history-plot:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid var(--focus); outline-offset: 2px; }
    #history-plot text { fill: var(--muted); font: 11px ui-monospace, monospace; }
    .chart-grid { stroke: #3c483a; stroke-width: 1; }
    .chart-line { fill: none; stroke: #a1ce8f; stroke-width: 2; stroke-linejoin: round; }
    .chart-point { fill: #a1ce8f; }
    .chart-cursor { stroke: var(--sage); stroke-width: 1; stroke-dasharray: 3 3; }
    #history-message { margin: 0; color: var(--muted); text-align: center; font-size: .8125rem; line-height: 1.7; }
    .chart-detail { min-height: 1.5em; margin: 0; color: var(--muted); font: .6875rem/1.5 ui-monospace, monospace; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
    .split { position: relative; display: inline-flex; max-width: 100%; }
    #download { min-width: 0; }
    #channel-toggle { margin-left: -2px; padding: 17px 16px; gap: 0; flex: 0 0 auto; }
    #channel-toggle svg { width: 16px; height: 16px; flex-basis: 16px; transition: transform .1s; }
    #channel-toggle[aria-expanded="true"] svg { transform: rotate(180deg); }
    .channel-menu { position: absolute; top: calc(100% + 16px); right: 0; z-index: 2; width: 300px; max-width: calc(100vw - 48px); margin: 0; padding: 6px; border: 2px solid var(--panel-border); background: var(--surface); box-shadow: 0 16px 40px #0008; text-align: left; }
    .channel-menu[hidden] { display: none; }
    button.channel-option { display: block; width: 100%; min-height: 0; padding: 10px 12px 10px 34px; border: 0; background: transparent; box-shadow: none; text-shadow: none; font: 600 .9375rem/1.4 system-ui, sans-serif; text-align: left; }
    button.channel-option:hover, button.channel-option:focus-visible { background: var(--raised); filter: none; }
    button.channel-option:active { transform: none; box-shadow: none; }
    button.channel-option:focus-visible { outline: 3px solid var(--focus); outline-offset: -3px; }
    button.channel-option::before { content: ''; position: absolute; left: 12px; top: 15px; width: 10px; height: 10px; border: 2px solid var(--muted); }
    button.channel-option[aria-checked="true"]::before { background: var(--cinnabar-red); border-color: #fff; }
    .channel-option .hint { display: block; color: var(--muted); font-weight: 400; font-size: .8125rem; }
    dialog { width: min(560px, calc(100% - 32px)); padding: 28px; border: 2px solid var(--panel-border); background: var(--surface); color: #fff; box-shadow: 0 16px 80px #0008; }
    dialog::backdrop { background: #0009; backdrop-filter: blur(3px); }
    dialog h2 { margin: 0 40px 16px 0; font: 700 1.25rem/1.4 ui-monospace, monospace; }
    dialog p { color: var(--sage); line-height: 1.6; }
    dialog .close { position: absolute; right: 12px; top: 12px; min-height: 36px; width: 36px; padding: 0; background: transparent; border: 0; box-shadow: none; font-size: 1.5rem; }
    .command-row { display: flex; gap: 10px; align-items: center; }
    #install-command { width: 100%; min-width: 0; background: var(--input-ground); border: 1px solid var(--panel-border); padding: 14px; color: #fff; font: .875rem/1.5 ui-monospace, monospace; }
    #copy-command { min-height: 48px; padding: 10px 14px; font-size: .875rem; }
    .download-option { display: block; padding: 14px 18px; margin-top: 10px; color: #fff; border: 1px solid var(--panel-border); background: var(--raised); text-decoration: none; font: 600 1rem/1.5 system-ui, sans-serif; }
    .download-option:hover { background: #3a4739; }
    .download-option:focus-visible, #install-command:focus-visible { outline: 3px solid var(--focus); outline-offset: 3px; }
    .disclaimer { width: 100%; margin: 28px 0 0; padding: 16px; border: 1px solid var(--notice-border); background: var(--notice-ground); color: var(--warning); text-align: left; font: 400 .75rem/1.7 system-ui, sans-serif; }
    .first-open { margin: 20px 0 0; font-size: .875rem; }
    .first-open code { display: block; margin-top: 8px; padding: 10px; background: var(--input-ground); overflow-wrap: anywhere; font: .8125rem/1.6 ui-monospace, monospace; }
    #copy-status { margin-bottom: 0; font-size: .875rem; }
    .hero { width: 100%; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; padding: 36px 0 32px; }
    @media (max-width: 700px) {
      .hero { padding: 28px 0; }
      .logo-motion { margin-bottom: 12px; }
      .description { font-size: 1.125rem; }
      .actions { width: 100%; margin-top: 24px; }
      .split { width: 100%; }
      #download { flex: 1; }
      .online-count { font-size: .75rem; }
    }
    @media (max-width: 480px) {
      #channel-toggle { padding: 16px 12px; }
      .channel-menu { left: 0; right: auto; width: 100%; max-width: none; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  @@SITE_HEADER@@
  <main>
    <div class="hero">
      <div class="logo-motion"><img class="logo" src="/title.png" alt="Cinnabar" width="1022" height="282"></div>
      <p class="description">A familiar world. A new client.</p>
      <p class="edition">Minecraft Bedrock client</p>
      <div class="actions">
        <div class="split" id="download-split">
          <button type="button" id="download"><svg viewBox="0 0 20 20" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M8 2h4v7h4l-6 6-6-6h4zM3 15h3v2h8v-2h3v5H3z"/></svg><span id="download-label">Download for your device</span></button>
          <button type="button" id="channel-toggle" aria-haspopup="menu" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="channel-menu" aria-label="Choose download channel"><svg viewBox="0 0 20 20" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 7h12l-6 7z"/></svg></button>
          <div class="channel-menu" id="channel-menu" role="menu" aria-label="Download channel" hidden>
            <button type="button" class="channel-option" id="channel-beta" role="menuitemradio" aria-checked="true" data-channel="beta">Beta<span class="hint">Recommended</span></button>
            <button type="button" class="channel-option" id="channel-nightly" role="menuitemradio" aria-checked="false" data-channel="nightly">Nightly (Unstable)<span class="hint">Built daily from dev and may break.</span></button>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="disclaimer" role="note">Cinnabar is a non-vanilla client and still in development. Its movement and combat may not yet match the official client exactly, so server anticheats may flag you and some servers may ban you. Play on servers at your own risk.</p>
    </div>
    <section class="player-history" aria-labelledby="history-title">
      <div class="chart-header">
        <h2 id="history-title">Players online</h2>
        <div class="chart-ranges" role="group" aria-label="Player history range">
          <button type="button" data-history-range="24h" aria-pressed="true">24h</button>
          <button type="button" data-history-range="7d" aria-pressed="false">7d</button>
          <button type="button" data-history-range="30d" aria-pressed="false">30d</button>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="online-count" id="online-count" role="status" aria-atomic="true"></p>
      <p class="chart-summary" id="history-summary"></p>
      <div class="chart-body">
        <svg id="history-plot" role="img" tabindex="0" aria-label="Player count history. Use left and right arrow keys to inspect samples." aria-describedby="history-summary history-detail" hidden></svg>
        <p id="history-message" role="status">Loading player history…</p>
      </div>
      <p class="chart-detail" id="history-detail" aria-live="polite"></p>
      <noscript><p>Enable JavaScript to view player history.</p></noscript>
    </section>
  </main>
  <dialog id="install-dialog" aria-labelledby="install-title">
    <button type="button" class="close" id="close-dialog" aria-label="Close">×</button>
    <h2 id="install-title">Install Cinnabar</h2>
    <div id="linux-install" hidden>
      <p>Paste this command into your terminal. It installs Cinnabar for your user and adds it to your app menu.</p>
      <div class="command-row"><input id="install-command" aria-label="Linux install command" readonly><button type="button" id="copy-command">Copy</button></div>
      <p id="copy-status" role="status"></p>
    </div>
    <div id="macos-install" hidden>
      <p>Choose your Mac, then open the disk image and drag Cinnabar into Applications.</p>
      <a class="download-option" data-release-asset="macos/arm64">Apple silicon (M series)</a>
      <a class="download-option" data-release-asset="macos/x86_64">Intel Mac</a>
      <p class="first-open">If macOS blocks the first launch, run this once in Terminal, then open Cinnabar again:<code>xattr -dr com.apple.quarantine /Applications/Cinnabar.app</code></p>
    </div>
    <div id="desktop-install" hidden>
      <p>Choose a platform to download Cinnabar.</p>
      <a class="download-option" data-release-asset="android/arm64">Android — ARM64 APK</a>
      <a class="download-option" data-release-asset="windows/x86_64">Windows setup</a>
      <a class="download-option" data-release-asset="linux/x86_64">Linux AppImage</a>
      <a class="download-option" data-release-asset="macos/arm64">macOS — Apple silicon</a>
      <a class="download-option" data-release-asset="macos/x86_64">macOS — Intel</a>
    </div>
  </dialog>
  <script src="/downloads.js" defer></script>
  <script src="/app.js" defer></script>
  <script src="/presence.js" defer></script>
  <script src="/history.js" defer></script>
</body>
</html>
